        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cranberry_Township%2C_Butler_County%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The township's first European settlers, Mathew and William Graham, arrived in 1796 and established several local businesses, including a tavern and a distillery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
