      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cranberry_Township%2C_Butler_County%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Cranberry Twp is home to the Cranberry Township Historical Society, which was formed in 1984 to preserve the community's early history and artifacts.",
